1.7.0.0 and ChartKitchen byDatenWG 1.53.0.0, from visuals/dist of dwg cli), src/vendor/dwg-pixelgrid and
fabric/caldova-finance.Report (incl. the registered P&L Statement visual, visuals/pbiviz/pnlByDatenWG.1.7.0.0.pbiviz
